{% block content %}

<div class="container legal">

  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

  <p>
    Shawarma Time &amp; Place is committed to protecting your privacy.
    This statement explains what information we collect when you use our
    website and how it is used. Questions? Contact us at
    <a href="mailto:info@shawarmatimeandplace.ca">
      info@shawarmatimeandplace.ca
    </a>.
  </p>


  <h2>Who we are</h2>

  <p>
    Our website address is
    <a href="https://shawarmatimeandplace.ca">
      https://shawarmatimeandplace.ca
    </a>
    (shawarmatimeandplace.com redirects here). We are a shawarma
    restaurant in the heart of Ottawa's ByWard Market, offering authentic
    shawarmas, poutines and Mexican-fusion creations inspired by Lebanese
    culinary heritage.
  </p>


  <h2>Cookies &amp; stored data</h2>

  <p>
    This site stores a single preference in your browser: your language
    choice (English or French), so the site remembers it on your next visit.
    It contains no personal data and can be cleared at any time through your
    browser settings.
  </p>


  <h2>Analytics</h2>

  <p>
    We may use Microsoft Clarity and Microsoft Advertising to understand how
    visitors use our website (behavioural metrics, heatmaps and session
    replay) so we can improve it. Data collected through these tools is
    controlled by Microsoft and processed according to the
    <a
      href="https://www.microsoft.com/privacy/privacystatement"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
    >Microsoft Privacy Statement</a>.
    It cannot be used to personally identify you. To view, delete or manage
    this data, use the
    <a
      href="https://account.microsoft.com/privacy"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
    >Microsoft Privacy Dashboard</a>.
  </p>


  <h2>What we don't do</h2>

  <p>
    We do not run user accounts, we do not collect payment information on
    this site (ordering is handled by Uber Eats under their own privacy
    policy), and we do not sell or share personally identifiable information
    with third parties.
  </p>


  <h2>Contact</h2>

  <p>
    Shawarma Time &amp; Place · 6 Byward Market Square, Ottawa, ON K1N 5M4 ·
    <a href="tel:+16132412882">+1 (613) 241-2882</a> ·
    <a href="mailto:info@shawarmatimeandplace.ca">
      info@shawarmatimeandplace.ca
    </a>
  </p>

</div>

{% endblock %}
